Hi <%= @merchant.name %>,

Welcome to OpenTrust. <%= @merchant.business_name %> is approved and your account has <%= number_with_delimiter(OpenTrust::FREE_CHECKS) %> free checks.

Log in and create your API key: <%= login_url %>

To get started:
1. Create an API key from your dashboard. It's shown once, so keep it somewhere safe.
2. Use the Ruby gem or the Node.js package (<%= libraries_url %>), or call the API directly: <%= docs_url %>
3. Check a customer's number before you ship, and share your own experiences so other merchants benefit too.

Every result carries a short notice that reports are unverified observations, not a finding about anyone. Please show it to anyone who sees a result. Need more checks later? Just write to <%= OpenTrust::FEEDBACK_EMAIL %>.

<%= "You're receiving this because #{@merchant.business_name} was registered on opentrust.in with this address." %>
